<title>LATVIA: SECURITIES COMMISSION SHARE REGISTRATIONS.</title>
<headline>SECURITIES COMMISSION SHARE REGISTRATIONS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The securities commission on Wednesday said it has registered the following share issues:</p>
<p>    Liepajas metalurgs   : 8,495,000 shares</p>
<p>    Olainfarm		: 2,994,900 shares</p>
<p>    Riga Jewellery works : 2,994,900 shares</p>
<p>    Struzha peat	   : 454,431 shares</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
